## Props

```
export type LegacyExportLetProps = {
  /** Legacy label text. */
  label?: string = "Legacy";
  /** Legacy count. */
  count: number;
}
```

## Events

```
export type LegacyExportLetEvents = {
  change: CustomEvent<string>; // on:change
}
```

## Slots

Each slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.

```
export type LegacyExportLetSlots = {
  default: {};
  footer: {};
}
```